              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Die Mutter schimpft, weil die Kinder so laut sind. The mother is scolding because the children are so noisy."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Mit jemandem schimpfen — to tell someone off. Über etwas schimpfen — to grumble about something."
